# Pikachu Agent — configuration
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this example never contains a real value.
#
# Resolution order (see src/pikachu/config.py :: get_api_key):
#   1. the real process environment
#   2. pikachu/.env
#   3. ../api/.env        <- the host app's existing file, so a key set there already works
#
# Only OPENROUTER_API_KEY is required, and only for the live tests. The offline suite
# (251 tests) needs no credential and blocks network access outright.

# OpenRouter key. Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. The model is pinned in src/pikachu/config.py as DEFAULT_MODEL and enforced by
# tests/test_model_policy.py, which fails the build on any gemini 1.x/2.x reference. Do not
# add a model override here expecting it to be honoured - change DEFAULT_MODEL instead, so the
# decision stays in one reviewed place.
